        ...cutting out the middle computation, which is to
        say that the positions at time $t = 0$ of our 
        newly-defined particles 
        |> InlineImage
            class ch4_inline_blackwhite_particles
            src images/svg_ch4_circle_at_2_4_p1_inline.svg
        , 
